cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OrthoGather"
abstract: >
  A locally hosted web application that integrates orthology inference with
  Gene Ontology enrichment for comparative proteome analysis. It retrieves
  reference and non-reference proteomes from UniProt, runs OrthoFinder to
  infer orthogroups, explores orthogroup composition across species, and
  tests Gene Ontology over-representation with GOATOOLS.
type: software
version: "2.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-14"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
url: "https://github.com/CarlosVivasR/OrthoGather"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CarlosVivasR/OrthoGather"
keywords:
  - comparative proteomics
  - orthology
  - orthogroups
  - Gene Ontology enrichment
  - OrthoFinder
  - non-model organisms
